1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,190
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,460
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,730
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,000
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:13,800
[Phop Phra, Tak]

6
00:00:56,880 --> 00:01:07,160
♫At this hour, I shall solemnly solicit♫

7
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:12,920
♫The sacred master
to whom I am deeply indebted♫

8
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:19,600
♫To protect and to shield my spirit♫

9
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:28,000
♫With the holy mantra♫

10
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:37,320
♫Incantation, and sorcery
arching over the sky♫

11
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:52,280
♫There dwell ethereal blessings,
veiled in protection, to guard the mortal wight♫

12
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,350
Master Bulan.

13
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:14,420
You can't be in here.

14
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,580
The master is in the middle of a ritual.

15
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:18,010
I am a cop.

16
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:20,380
I need to speak with her now.

17
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:25,900
I have something important
to discuss with you.

18
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:09,550
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

19
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:14,290
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

20
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:18,470
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

21
00:03:18,510 --> 00:03:22,780
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

22
00:03:22,830 --> 00:03:27,210
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

23
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:31,920
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

24
00:03:31,950 --> 00:03:35,970
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

25
00:03:35,990 --> 00:03:40,440
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

26
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:46,060
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

27
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:11,170
[A day earlier]

28
00:04:14,450 --> 00:04:15,190
Peem,

29
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,560
how many of these have you had?

30
00:04:18,170 --> 00:04:20,020
You planning to stay up all night or what?

31
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:22,370
If I fall asleep

32
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:24,400
and Krating suddenly shows up,

33
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:25,780
what are you gonna do?

34
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:29,530
It wasn't easy

35
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:31,670
getting a lead on his hideout, Phu.

36
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:37,360
Never in a million years
will I let him slip through my fingers.

37
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,720
Peem,

38
00:04:41,330 --> 00:04:42,640
I'm serious.

39
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:46,020
Ever since what happened with Pat,

40
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:49,310
you've been working yourself
to the bone every day.

41
00:04:51,570 --> 00:04:53,540
I think you need to take a break.

42
00:04:58,450 --> 00:04:59,530
I know.

43
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:01,820
I tried!

44
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:03,790
But you know what?

45
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:06,550
I haven't slept soundly since.

46
00:05:07,710 --> 00:05:08,710
I'm afraid that

47
00:05:08,820 --> 00:05:10,710
if I fall asleep,

48
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,910
something bad will happen again.

49
00:05:14,810 --> 00:05:15,890
Peem,

50
00:05:17,450 --> 00:05:19,250
you do know that Pat's death

51
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,990
wasn't your fault, right?

52
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:34,610
Next month would've been Pat's birthday.

53
00:05:36,530 --> 00:05:38,520
I was going to buy this for her.

54
00:05:42,420 --> 00:05:44,810
Pat came to me in a dream once, Peem.

55
00:05:45,230 --> 00:05:46,610
It was as though...

56
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:49,260
she was coming to collect
the present I'd promised to buy her.

57
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,720
And in your dream...

58
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:55,590
what was she like?

59
00:05:58,410 --> 00:05:59,590
Just the same.

60
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:04,840
She was wearing
her favorite blue floral shirt

61
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:06,460
you bought her.

62
00:06:08,570 --> 00:06:10,690
She loved that shirt, Peem.

63
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:14,130
Even after she wore it until it tore,

64
00:06:15,670 --> 00:06:16,900
she still had it mended.

65
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,320
She refused to throw it away.

66
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:22,500
I want to see her, too.

67
00:06:24,470 --> 00:06:26,210
Then, on her birthday next month,

68
00:06:26,850 --> 00:06:28,570
let's go see her together.

69
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:31,370
I'll give her this present.

70
00:06:32,410 --> 00:06:33,410
Mm,

71
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,620
let's do that.

72
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:47,100
I have a present for her, too.

73
00:06:51,910 --> 00:06:52,910
Phu.

74
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:56,600
We've spotted the target.
He's entering the warehouse.

75
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,670
All units, stand by.

76
00:06:57,690 --> 00:06:58,890
Await further instructions.

77
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:03,130
Peem!

78
00:07:03,150 --> 00:07:03,910
Peem!

79
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,790
Peem!

80
00:07:17,810 --> 00:07:18,600
Stop!

81
00:07:19,990 --> 00:07:20,720
Don't move!

82
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:22,360
Drop your weapon!

83
00:07:23,090 --> 00:07:23,780
Put your hands up!

84
00:07:25,230 --> 00:07:26,000
Don't move!

85
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:26,920
Sit!!

86
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:39,420
Sarge, take it from here.

87
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,700
Peem!

88
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:42,320
Take care of this.

89
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:53,090
Stop!

90
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,180
You piece of shit, I told you to stop!

91
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:07,960
Peem, what are you doing?

92
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,470
We've got the guy.

93
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:16,500
The suspect was shot once in the torso.

94
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:18,210
Send for an ambulance.

95
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:21,220
Four officers were injured

96
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,080
during the arrest.

97
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,040
Fucking shoot!!

98
00:09:59,210 --> 00:10:00,380
You are...

99
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:02,870
so fucking annoying, officer.

100
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:07,900
Don't even think

101
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:09,290
you'll get away from me.

102
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,580
What the fuck did I ever do to you

103
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:14,800
to make you fixate on me
like a dog with a bone?

104
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:19,160
It's your little sister, huh?

105
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:23,300
No wonder...

106
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:24,820
when that wench was on my bed...

107
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,490
Shut the fuck up, you fucking bastard!

108
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,000
Your sister really took after you.

109
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:37,530
Hey!

110
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:00,410
Stop!

111
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:04,980
I said stop!

112
00:11:25,730 --> 00:11:26,490
You piece of shit!

113
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:33,780
(Incanting)

114
00:11:52,610 --> 00:11:55,190
Your gun jammed, officer?

115
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:07,660
Your brother's not, though.

116
00:12:45,230 --> 00:12:46,000
Phu...

117
00:12:46,270 --> 00:12:46,970
Phu.

118
00:12:47,020 --> 00:12:47,800
Phu.

119
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,000
Phu!

120
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,040
Phu.

121
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:58,560
Phu...

122
00:12:59,050 --> 00:13:00,820
Then, on her birthday next month,

123
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,200
let's go see her together.

124
00:13:04,170 --> 00:13:05,050
Let's do that.

125
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:07,580
I want to see her, too.

126
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:10,120
Family of the injured patient,
please wait outside.

127
00:13:17,110 --> 00:13:20,280
[Emergency Room]

128
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:27,380
I have a present for her, too.

129
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:43,690
Peem.

130
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:54,790
Mom...

131
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:23,290
Dad, I'm sorry.

132
00:14:34,710 --> 00:14:36,720
I have something important
to discuss with you.

133
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:40,280
What is it?

134
00:14:41,610 --> 00:14:42,900
Anyone who comes here

135
00:14:43,110 --> 00:14:44,590
comes with a troubled soul.

136
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:47,310
You must wait your turn.

137
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:52,700
If you cannot wait, then leave.

138
00:15:09,910 --> 00:15:10,720
Sure.

139
00:15:11,590 --> 00:15:12,900
I'll wait in the car, then.

140
00:15:39,210 --> 00:15:40,310
What are you doing?

141
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,820
The sanctum is closed.

142
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,590
Then why did you tell me to wait?

143
00:15:47,530 --> 00:15:49,340
I wasn't gonna wait for hours on end

144
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,680
just for you to tell me
that the sanctum is closed.

145
00:15:55,690 --> 00:15:56,690
Okay.

146
00:15:57,900 --> 00:16:00,710
Let me formally introduce myself.

147
00:16:00,950 --> 00:16:01,850
I am

148
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,720
Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun,

149
00:16:04,810 --> 00:16:06,990
a detective from Bangkok.

150
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,000
You can call me Peem or...

151
00:16:08,020 --> 00:16:08,990
What do you want?

152
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,400
Bullets.

153
00:16:14,710 --> 00:16:15,880
I need bullets

154
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:18,500
that can stop invulnerable criminals
with impenetrable skin,

155
00:16:19,110 --> 00:16:21,080
the kind who pratice black magic like you do.

156
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:23,230
I do not practice black magic.

157
00:16:23,910 --> 00:16:25,920
There is nothing I can do, Lieutenant.

158
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:27,780
There's nothing you can do,

159
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:30,230
or do you just not care to help?

160
00:16:36,110 --> 00:16:37,480
How about this?

161
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:41,520
The fee you received today,

162
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:44,720
I'm happy to double it

163
00:16:44,950 --> 00:16:47,540
in exchange for making those bullets.

164
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:51,160
Leave

165
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:53,580
before you find yourself in affliction.

166
00:16:54,970 --> 00:16:55,850
So?

167
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:57,940
When people said

168
00:16:58,010 --> 00:17:00,740
your father was such a benevolent man,

169
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:03,160
it was all a lie, wasn't it?

170
00:17:06,190 --> 00:17:09,420
And everything being fabricated here

171
00:17:09,610 --> 00:17:12,640
is just a scam to exploit people's faith.

172
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:15,020
I myself must question

173
00:17:16,410 --> 00:17:17,700
whether you are here

174
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:19,980
in search of justice,

175
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:22,520
or merely...

176
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:24,920
to have me aid you in killing.

177
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:29,790
I'm not an officer
who would kill someone outside the law.

178
00:17:29,810 --> 00:17:31,190
I'm here

179
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,600
to uphold justice!

180
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,900
You dare play with faith,

181
00:17:36,470 --> 00:17:38,400
yet you have none yourself.

182
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:39,510
What in all realms...

183
00:17:39,530 --> 00:17:41,400
could possibly come to your rescue?

184
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,690
So what do I have to do
to get you to help me?

185
00:17:45,410 --> 00:17:46,280
Just say it!

186
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,620
I still have faith in goodness,

187
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:53,520
and anything auspicious

188
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:57,320
should aid those who think and do good.

189
00:17:58,910 --> 00:18:01,000
Do you understand what I'm saying?

190
00:18:03,690 --> 00:18:06,600
Should you be determined
to find answers to this matter,

191
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,990
stay the night here

192
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:11,080
at my sanctum.

193
00:18:13,710 --> 00:18:14,500
For?

194
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:16,560
What for?

195
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:19,920
If you're not going to help,

196
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:22,590
there's no reason for me to stay.

197
00:18:23,170 --> 00:18:24,140
If you'll excuse me.

198
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:25,760
If you do not...

199
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,320
come before me tonight,

200
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:32,310
do not expect...

201
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:34,640
a peaceful slumber.

202
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:14,760
Next month would've been Pat's birthday.

203
00:19:16,450 --> 00:19:18,300
I was going to buy this for her.

204
00:19:47,690 --> 00:19:48,690
The doctor said...

205
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,700
the surgery went well,

206
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:52,720
and nothing looked concerning.

207
00:19:54,250 --> 00:19:55,480
They will keep him
overnight for observation

208
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:57,480
and probably transfer him
to a recovery room.

209
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:07,910
Peem.

210
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:10,380
What you've witnessed

211
00:20:11,530 --> 00:20:12,810
is called sorcery.

212
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,710
[Invulnerability Yantra]

213
00:20:28,700 --> 00:20:29,970
Sorcery...

214
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,430
What do you mean, Dad?

215
00:20:34,610 --> 00:20:35,790
Back then,

216
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:37,480
I didn't believe

217
00:20:37,750 --> 00:20:39,580
such things were real myself

218
00:20:40,890 --> 00:20:42,100
until...

219
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:45,010
I witnessed it with my own eyes.

220
00:20:47,590 --> 00:20:49,460
Back when I first joined the force,

221
00:20:50,290 --> 00:20:52,290
I was assigned to capture
a criminal in a robbery-murder case.

222
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,300
Turns out...

223
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:57,010
the guy knew sorcery

224
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:59,700
and had an Invulnerability Yantra
tattooed on him,

225
00:21:00,420 --> 00:21:01,930
making him impervious
to any blades or bullets.

226
00:21:03,590 --> 00:21:05,110
My boss

227
00:21:05,390 --> 00:21:08,110
had to summon a master
from the North to capture him.

228
00:21:08,570 --> 00:21:15,380
(Incanting)

229
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:16,880
May it be ravaged,

230
00:21:16,910 --> 00:21:18,390
may it be ruined,

231
00:21:18,410 --> 00:21:21,870
may it be blighted
by the power of Namo Buddhaya.

232
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:23,080
Do use them

233
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:25,910
to uphold justice, as is your duty.

234
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:59,790
[How to make consecrated bullets]

235
00:21:59,810 --> 00:22:00,580
So...

236
00:22:01,170 --> 00:22:03,610
where is this master you're talking about?

237
00:22:03,710 --> 00:22:05,410
How can I get in touch with him or...

238
00:22:05,490 --> 00:22:06,680
meet him?

239
00:22:07,950 --> 00:22:09,720
That master passed away many years ago,

240
00:22:10,710 --> 00:22:12,090
but he had a daughter

241
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,080
to whom he passed down his sacred arts.

242
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:17,600
If you still want to capture Krating,

243
00:22:18,990 --> 00:22:21,620
you have to go see
Master In's daughter.

244
00:22:22,140 --> 00:22:23,790
Master In's daughter...

245
00:22:23,900 --> 00:22:25,040
Who is she?

246
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:30,270
Master Bulan.

247
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,480
[Master Bulan]

248
00:23:14,740 --> 00:23:15,910
If you do not...

249
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:18,500
come before me tonight,

250
00:23:19,350 --> 00:23:20,400
do not expect...

251
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:22,700
a peaceful slumber.

252
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:40,280
Mommy,

253
00:23:40,300 --> 00:23:42,290
I have returned to pray before bed,

254
00:23:42,310 --> 00:23:44,680
as I promised you.

255
00:23:45,890 --> 00:23:46,840
Good.

256
00:23:47,390 --> 00:23:48,880
The merit you diligently cultivate

257
00:23:49,090 --> 00:23:50,790
is never in vain.

258
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:52,530
When it is time,

259
00:23:52,740 --> 00:23:55,240
you will be born in a better realm.

260
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:57,070
I am not going anywhere.

261
00:23:57,090 --> 00:23:58,680
I will stay here with you.

262
00:23:58,980 --> 00:23:59,870
Anyway...

263
00:23:59,900 --> 00:24:01,700
the person you invited to stay the night,

264
00:24:01,730 --> 00:24:02,940
who is she?

265
00:24:11,280 --> 00:24:13,690
She is someone Master said

266
00:24:14,410 --> 00:24:16,500
I would eventually cross paths with.

267
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:20,470
Then why did you
make her sleep in the sanctum, Mommy?

268
00:24:20,570 --> 00:24:22,480
It is much more comfortable here.

269
00:24:24,970 --> 00:24:26,750
Because she will soon face danger.

270
00:26:33,170 --> 00:26:35,380
If I agree to stay the night here,

271
00:26:35,800 --> 00:26:37,640
you will help me with the bullets, right?

272
00:26:38,100 --> 00:26:40,290
Let us see if you make it through tonight,

273
00:26:40,380 --> 00:26:41,580
officer.

274
00:27:17,540 --> 00:27:19,530
I'd better not find out
you opened the sanctum

275
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:21,510
just to scam money out of people.

276
00:27:22,990 --> 00:27:24,890
I'll make sure to get you
nice and settled elsewhere.

277
00:27:42,940 --> 00:27:43,680
Who is that?

278
00:27:54,120 --> 00:27:55,450
I asked, who is that?

279
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:29,710
Who?!

280
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,460
Grandfather would not allow me in, Mommy.

281
00:29:32,490 --> 00:29:35,180
Not even to teach her a lesson.

282
00:29:35,210 --> 00:29:37,270
I could not touch her.

283
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:49,940
This voice...

284
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:55,000
It is something that closely follows her.

285
00:30:08,830 --> 00:30:11,190
Return to where you came from.

286
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:15,180
If you refuse to listen when I ask nicely,

287
00:30:15,800 --> 00:30:18,140
I shall make sure you are never born again.

288
00:31:08,650 --> 00:31:09,590
Te cha su me.

289
00:31:09,610 --> 00:31:12,220
Om, may the sacred fire deity manifest.

290
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:13,420
Aggi aggam.

291
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:15,200
I shall wake the kalpa-destroying fire.

292
00:31:15,220 --> 00:31:17,030
Namo Buddhaya.

293
00:31:19,250 --> 00:31:23,540
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

294
00:31:23,560 --> 00:31:28,280
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

295
00:31:28,300 --> 00:31:32,460
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

296
00:31:32,500 --> 00:31:36,770
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

297
00:31:36,820 --> 00:31:41,200
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

298
00:31:41,250 --> 00:31:45,960
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

299
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:51,540
I shall later dedicate my merits to you.

300
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,730
Where on earth is she?

301
00:32:22,370 --> 00:32:24,570
Lieutenant, what is it
you are doing at my home?

302
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:47,260
I'm sorry.

303
00:32:47,690 --> 00:32:49,200
I didn't mean to.

304
00:32:59,170 --> 00:32:59,860
Hey.

305
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,000
Hey!

306
00:33:01,630 --> 00:33:03,580
What about the bullets you promised?

307
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,090
Hey!

308
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:06,620
Hey, you!

309
00:33:14,740 --> 00:33:16,170
Once you're done giving alms,

310
00:33:16,300 --> 00:33:17,680
we have to talk about the bullets.

311
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:21,190
Will you stand there,

312
00:33:21,740 --> 00:33:23,660
or will you join me in giving alms here?

313
00:33:31,380 --> 00:33:32,670
I humbly invite you, Venerable Sir.

314
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,540
Now, pour the water
and receive the blessings.

315
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:36,030
(Chanting a blessing)

316
00:34:41,180 --> 00:34:41,750
Lieutenant,

317
00:34:41,770 --> 00:34:43,600
come make a water offering
for your karmic enemy.

318
00:34:46,490 --> 00:34:47,880
Dedicate part of your merits

319
00:34:47,900 --> 00:34:50,090
to those who are
still trapped in the karmic bond.

320
00:34:54,540 --> 00:34:58,190
That will ease her suffering.

321
00:35:03,890 --> 00:35:17,400
(Chanting a blessing)

322
00:35:45,610 --> 00:35:47,090
May you be happy.

323
00:35:47,290 --> 00:35:50,180
May your wishes be fulfilled.

324
00:35:50,460 --> 00:35:51,900
May you be blessed.

325
00:36:06,380 --> 00:36:07,970
Where do I pour this?

326
00:36:47,990 --> 00:36:50,310
"Pichapat Ruechakun."

327
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,470
That's Pat's full name.

328
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:55,090
My sister.

329
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,890
She passed away last year.

330
00:37:00,490 --> 00:37:03,380
If the person you talked about is her,

331
00:37:03,410 --> 00:37:05,890
please just tell me

332
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:08,200
how she's doing.

333
00:37:08,990 --> 00:37:11,470
I'd also like to know

334
00:37:11,590 --> 00:37:13,700
if she's doing fine right now,

335
00:37:14,270 --> 00:37:17,080
because ever since
what happened that day,

336
00:37:18,070 --> 00:37:20,080
I've never seen her,

337
00:37:20,900 --> 00:37:22,480
never felt her,

338
00:37:23,540 --> 00:37:24,400
never...

339
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:26,300
even dreamed of her.

340
00:37:27,390 --> 00:37:28,120
Come on.

341
00:37:28,990 --> 00:37:30,300
Let's go home.

342
00:37:34,290 --> 00:37:37,370
What still lingers in my memory

343
00:37:38,910 --> 00:37:40,320
is nothing but the scenes

344
00:37:40,340 --> 00:37:42,140
of what happened to Pat.

345
00:37:46,180 --> 00:37:46,980
Pat,

346
00:37:47,580 --> 00:37:49,000
I forgot my phone.

347
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:51,370
I'll be back in a sec.

348
00:37:57,290 --> 00:37:58,200
Pat...

349
00:37:59,890 --> 00:38:01,890
was raped by those bastards.

350
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:05,200
They recorded videos to blackmail her,

351
00:38:06,500 --> 00:38:08,380
forcing her to become their slave

352
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:10,490
and satisfy their lust.

353
00:38:26,510 --> 00:38:27,620
In the end...

354
00:38:31,780 --> 00:38:33,830
she couldn't handle it.

355
00:38:43,090 --> 00:38:44,090
Pat...

356
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:48,760
what are you doing?

357
00:38:53,600 --> 00:38:54,310
Pat!

358
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:09,490
From that moment on,

359
00:39:11,390 --> 00:39:13,700
I've never been able to sleep soundly,

360
00:39:14,090 --> 00:39:15,420
because I'm scared

361
00:39:16,590 --> 00:39:19,080
that if, one day, I fall asleep...

362
00:39:22,510 --> 00:39:24,990
I'll lose my loved ones once again.

363
00:39:30,180 --> 00:39:32,080
Your younger sister

364
00:39:32,590 --> 00:39:33,960
is not filled with joy,

365
00:39:35,290 --> 00:39:36,690
yet neither is she as troubled

366
00:39:36,990 --> 00:39:38,800
as she was when she was still alive.

367
00:39:41,480 --> 00:39:42,480
How do you know that?

368
00:39:45,590 --> 00:39:47,660
My little brother and I

369
00:39:48,270 --> 00:39:49,480
were chasing down the guy

370
00:39:49,500 --> 00:39:51,280
who did it to Pat so he could be punished.

371
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:54,040
But as my brother and I

372
00:39:54,070 --> 00:39:55,990
were about to close in on him,

373
00:39:59,700 --> 00:40:02,290
my brother was injured

374
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:06,090
and is now in critical condition.

375
00:40:07,100 --> 00:40:09,380
I know what you want,

376
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,790
but it is best to give up.

377
00:40:14,590 --> 00:40:17,060
If you meddle with vileness,

378
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:20,300
you will only put yourself in danger,

379
00:40:21,310 --> 00:40:23,490
just as you were haunted by those ghosts,

380
00:40:23,850 --> 00:40:25,290
until you could find no peace.

381
00:40:28,380 --> 00:40:29,460
What do you mean by that?

382
00:40:30,790 --> 00:40:31,980
I need not tell you,

383
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:33,710
yet you know too well what I mean.

384
00:40:34,970 --> 00:40:37,180
If you will not think of your own life,

385
00:40:37,630 --> 00:40:40,090
then think of your late sister.

386
00:40:40,940 --> 00:40:43,100
Consider how she could ever find happiness.

387
00:40:45,590 --> 00:40:46,670
Ghost this,

388
00:40:46,690 --> 00:40:48,100
ghost that.

389
00:40:48,450 --> 00:40:49,320
The more I hear this,

390
00:40:49,340 --> 00:40:50,700
the more I have to see it through.

391
00:40:54,890 --> 00:40:55,980
Do you have any idea

392
00:40:58,390 --> 00:41:00,180
how many innocent people out there,

393
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:01,710
apart from my little sister

394
00:41:01,730 --> 00:41:03,930
and my little brother,

395
00:41:03,950 --> 00:41:05,690
have been harmed by those guys?!

396
00:41:06,490 --> 00:41:08,060
Regardless of what you think,

397
00:41:08,450 --> 00:41:09,490
those innocent people

398
00:41:09,510 --> 00:41:11,730
deserve justice.

399
00:41:13,910 --> 00:41:16,080
I have to go home with the bullets,

400
00:41:16,310 --> 00:41:18,020
no matter what it takes.

401
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:36,680
Dad,

402
00:41:37,560 --> 00:41:38,780
could you have me

403
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:40,960
transferred to Phop Phra?

404
00:41:44,130 --> 00:41:45,270
Could you do it right now?

405
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,420
Thank you, Dad.

406
00:42:12,540 --> 00:42:15,380
They were born with the charm of metta.

407
00:42:15,870 --> 00:42:16,740
Master Bulan.

408
00:42:21,190 --> 00:42:24,800
They have a mark
in an auspicious position on their face.

409
00:42:40,920 --> 00:42:42,490
Stubborn by nature,

410
00:42:43,090 --> 00:42:46,270
never one to yield to anyone's objections.

411
00:42:51,210 --> 00:42:52,210
That...

412
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,880
is your karmic soulmate.

413
00:43:00,590 --> 00:43:03,280
Stay here, my beautiful daughter.

414
00:43:04,700 --> 00:43:06,890
Do not leave them.

415
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:09,770
One day...

416
00:43:10,290 --> 00:43:11,610
they will come to you.

417
00:43:27,680 --> 00:43:29,550
I'll go ahead and introduce her.

418
00:43:30,070 --> 00:43:32,600
This is Police Lieutenant Phitcha Ruechakun.

419
00:43:33,090 --> 00:43:34,890
She's a detective from Bangkok.

420
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:36,490
You can call me

421
00:43:36,540 --> 00:43:37,540
"Peem."

422
00:43:37,910 --> 00:43:40,290
I will be temporarily stationed here

423
00:43:40,390 --> 00:43:42,390
to investigate a human trafficking case.

424
00:43:43,090 --> 00:43:45,890
I'm not here only to help the victims,

425
00:43:46,460 --> 00:43:48,150
but I'm here...

426
00:43:48,580 --> 00:43:51,300
to eradicate the ones responsible,

427
00:43:51,400 --> 00:43:53,370
no matter where they might be hiding.

428
00:43:56,490 --> 00:43:58,410
This is the desk
for our beautiful lieutenant.

429
00:43:59,820 --> 00:44:00,620
Peace and quiet,

430
00:44:00,940 --> 00:44:01,980
but not private.

431
00:44:03,090 --> 00:44:04,400
You don't have to call me

432
00:44:04,570 --> 00:44:05,790
"Beautiful lieutenant."

433
00:44:05,950 --> 00:44:08,300
Just "Lieutenant Peem" is fine.

434
00:44:08,880 --> 00:44:09,600
Copy.

435
00:45:07,030 --> 00:45:08,010
You came here

436
00:45:08,020 --> 00:45:09,390
to see me?

437
00:45:09,410 --> 00:45:11,370
I made you breakfast,

438
00:45:11,400 --> 00:45:13,860
but you left in such haste
without eating it.

439
00:45:14,050 --> 00:45:16,930
So I have prepared
lunch for you in a tiffin.

440
00:45:17,010 --> 00:45:18,800
I do not know what food you favor,

441
00:45:18,830 --> 00:45:20,780
so I brought everything I had made.

442
00:45:22,550 --> 00:45:25,740
Sarge, why did you pass the dessert
between your legs?

443
00:45:25,760 --> 00:45:28,010
I've already told you
that no one can be trusted here.

444
00:45:28,470 --> 00:45:29,940
There are both magic and the dark arts.

445
00:45:29,970 --> 00:45:30,670
Sis!

446
00:45:31,070 --> 00:45:32,960
Someone wants you
to check on your daughter at school.

447
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:34,070
They're saying that

448
00:45:34,130 --> 00:45:35,500
she's possessed!

449
00:45:35,640 --> 00:45:37,350
By the sacred power of Namo Buddhaya.

450
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:38,800
What is this, Sarge?

451
00:45:38,860 --> 00:45:40,090
It seems she's possessed;

452
00:45:40,120 --> 00:45:41,880
otherwise, Master
wouldn't have been summoned here.

453
00:45:43,320 --> 00:45:44,090
- Excuse me.
- Lieutenant! Lieutenant!

454
00:45:44,120 --> 00:45:45,040
(Incanting)

455
00:45:45,060 --> 00:45:45,910
Stop!

456
00:45:49,090 --> 00:45:51,020
I have never minded
that you do not believe in it,

457
00:45:51,570 --> 00:45:53,210
but do not interrupt my ritual.

458
00:45:53,340 --> 00:45:56,160
What's this master of yours usually like?

459
00:45:56,740 --> 00:45:58,110
This lady... she's the real one.

460
00:45:58,140 --> 00:45:59,590
She's the best in all of Phop Phra.

461
00:45:59,810 --> 00:46:02,270
When afflictions come your way,

462
00:46:02,330 --> 00:46:04,130
even I cannot come to your rescue.

463
00:46:04,150 --> 00:46:05,790
Prove it to me, then.

464
00:46:06,030 --> 00:46:07,230
I'd also love to know

465
00:46:07,260 --> 00:46:08,370
if you could really banish ghosts

466
00:46:08,380 --> 00:46:10,140
if they were real.

467
00:46:31,980 --> 00:46:35,360
♫It's not that I don't feel it♫

468
00:46:35,390 --> 00:46:39,160
♫It's not that I'm cold-hearted♫

469
00:46:39,180 --> 00:46:42,790
♫For the love you've given♫

470
00:46:45,890 --> 00:46:49,190
♫It's because it feels too good to be true,♫

471
00:46:49,360 --> 00:46:52,670
♫So much so that I doubt if it's true♫

472
00:46:52,860 --> 00:46:59,590
♫If it's smoke and mirrors,
a dream that lingers♫

473
00:46:59,640 --> 00:47:05,300
♫Deeply swayed by love,
all while shaken with dread,♫

474
00:47:05,710 --> 00:47:11,860
♫Scared that it's not love
after all in the end♫

475
00:47:13,130 --> 00:47:17,760
♫What if, between us,♫

476
00:47:18,040 --> 00:47:23,310
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

477
00:47:23,330 --> 00:47:26,760
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

478
00:47:26,870 --> 00:47:31,740
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

479
00:47:31,780 --> 00:47:36,960
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

480
00:47:37,020 --> 00:47:43,070
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

481
00:47:55,370 --> 00:47:58,940
♫Can you so gently give me some time,♫

482
00:47:58,960 --> 00:48:02,450
♫For me to ponder what's on my mind?♫

483
00:48:02,480 --> 00:48:09,060
♫I would hate to be wavering
when love binds♫

484
00:48:09,190 --> 00:48:12,030
♫Deeply swayed by love,♫

485
00:48:12,050 --> 00:48:15,280
♫all while shaken with dread,♫

486
00:48:15,300 --> 00:48:22,980
♫Scared that it's not love
after all in the end♫

487
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:30,770
♫What if, between us,♫

488
00:48:30,980 --> 00:48:36,250
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

489
00:48:36,380 --> 00:48:39,910
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

490
00:48:40,020 --> 00:48:44,680
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

491
00:48:44,860 --> 00:48:49,940
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

492
00:48:49,960 --> 00:48:55,290
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

493
00:48:55,310 --> 00:49:00,490
♫Tell me it's not an illusion
you beautifully created♫

494
00:49:00,510 --> 00:49:07,230
♫Don't let my heart suffer
and ache inside this cage♫

495
00:49:07,280 --> 00:49:14,460
♫I would do anything just to escape♫

496
00:49:14,810 --> 00:49:19,480
♫What if, between us,♫

497
00:49:19,710 --> 00:49:24,980
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

498
00:49:25,040 --> 00:49:28,520
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

499
00:49:28,770 --> 00:49:33,480
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

500
00:49:33,700 --> 00:49:38,690
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

501
00:49:38,730 --> 00:49:45,080
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

502
00:49:52,620 --> 00:49:57,080
♫I don't want to lock my heart away♫

503
00:49:58,630 --> 00:50:03,130
♫I wish you'd know one day♫
